    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "The market answer is now clear: the problem is real, but “another Xero cash-flow dashboard” is not enough. Xero itself now includes 30/60/90/180-day cash-flow forecasting by plan, while Float explicitly sells a live 13-week forecast with collaboration and permissions, and Chaser already offers accountant-led receivables automation. FlowCast’s credible wedge is therefore the closed loop: identify a specific shortfall week → rank the debtors causing it → assign collection work → track promises/disputes → prove recovered cash. I’m encoding that positioning and the production blockers into build-ordered sprints, not simply adding more features."
     ]
